WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.739
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.009 --> 01:38.920
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.370 --> 01:41.729
[Episode 10]

4
01:41.990 --> 01:44.960
[Nanhuai]

5
02:00.430 --> 02:06.490
[Nanhuai Ming Newspaper]

6
02:07.660 --> 02:08.630
These are the records I found

7
02:08.630 --> 02:09.389
in the archives.

8
02:09.389 --> 02:10.190
Fifty people.

9
02:11.140 --> 02:12.100
The names match the list

10
02:12.100 --> 02:12.820
provided by the soldiers' families

11
02:12.820 --> 02:13.480
perfectly.

12
02:16.880 --> 02:17.640
So it's true.

13
02:18.720 --> 02:20.260
The Yu Army forcibly recruited soldiers

14
02:20.260 --> 02:21.610
to work in their private iron mine,

15
02:21.610 --> 02:22.620
then added those

16
02:22.650 --> 02:24.210
who died in the mining accident

17
02:24.210 --> 02:25.020
to the list of

18
02:25.020 --> 02:26.480
battlefield casualties,

19
02:26.620 --> 02:28.180
hoping to cover it all up.

20
02:28.500 --> 02:30.760
This wasn't just a baseless accusation.

21
02:31.500 --> 02:33.270
This is simply outrageous.

22
02:33.860 --> 02:34.420
I must seek justice

23
02:34.420 --> 02:35.450
for these soldiers

24
02:35.450 --> 02:36.510
who died unjustly.

25
02:38.540 --> 02:39.520
Even if we can prove

26
02:39.520 --> 02:40.850
this list is authentic,

27
02:41.460 --> 02:43.700
we still lack direct evidence

28
02:43.700 --> 02:46.230
that the soldiers were sent to work as miners.

29
02:47.300 --> 02:48.030
Looks like

30
02:49.829 --> 02:51.590
I'll have to keep searching for evidence

31
02:51.590 --> 02:52.730
within the Yu Army.

32
02:54.490 --> 02:55.329
Xueting.

33
02:56.560 --> 02:58.450
This is extremely dangerous.

34
02:59.350 --> 03:01.480
Have you really thought this through?

35
03:02.670 --> 03:03.730
I've long detested

36
03:04.630 --> 03:06.750
these warlords for subverting the constitution,

37
03:06.750 --> 03:09.330
abusing their power, and usurping the authority.

38
03:09.330 --> 03:11.000
I returned to our country

39
03:11.260 --> 03:12.660
to join the journalism industry

40
03:12.660 --> 03:15.060
precisely to expose their various crimes.

41
03:16.020 --> 03:16.760
Xueting.

42
03:18.040 --> 03:20.120
I know your talent and ambition.

43
03:21.300 --> 03:23.140
Once this mission succeeds,

44
03:23.530 --> 03:24.490
it will undoubtedly

45
03:24.490 --> 03:26.070
send shockwaves through the industry.

46
03:26.070 --> 03:27.130
When that happens,

47
03:27.260 --> 03:28.260
I'll make sure to introduce you

48
03:28.260 --> 03:30.020
to some key figures in the news industry.

49
03:30.020 --> 03:30.860
I'm confident

50
03:31.420 --> 03:32.420
you'll soon

51
03:32.420 --> 03:33.820
make a name for yourself.

52
03:38.020 --> 03:42.030
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

53
03:43.160 --> 03:51.170
[Conference Room]

54
03:44.660 --> 03:45.420
It would cost too much.

55
03:45.420 --> 03:46.300
Who'd fund it?

56
03:48.240 --> 03:49.800
Building guns and cannons is no joke.

57
03:49.800 --> 03:51.000
Just as you expected,

58
03:51.290 --> 03:52.530
the veterans all opposed

59
03:52.530 --> 03:55.190
allocating military funds to build an arsenal.

60
03:56.200 --> 03:57.380
Today's meeting

61
03:57.960 --> 03:59.020
was never meant

62
03:59.020 --> 04:00.280
to get their approval.

63
04:00.600 --> 04:01.540
I just wanted to put their opposition

64
04:01.540 --> 04:02.580
on the table.

65
04:02.870 --> 04:04.470
Since this route is blocked,

66
04:04.670 --> 04:06.580
they can't blame me for taking another one.

67
04:06.110 --> 04:13.970
[Conference Room]

68
04:06.980 --> 04:07.480
Got it.

69
04:07.850 --> 04:09.250
I'll see to it right away.

70
04:16.560 --> 04:18.160
How am I supposed to tell him?

71
04:18.519 --> 04:19.760
Saying this won't work.

72
04:19.760 --> 04:21.490
Saying that won't work either.

73
04:23.460 --> 04:24.520
What are you doing?

74
04:24.600 --> 04:25.080
Look.

75
04:25.110 --> 04:26.260
Y-You don't have to

76
04:26.260 --> 04:27.490
keep things from me, you know?

77
04:27.490 --> 04:29.260
That plot of land on Changping Mountain—

78
04:29.260 --> 04:30.680
you said you were building a racecourse,

79
04:30.680 --> 04:31.340
but you were clearly planning

80
04:31.340 --> 04:33.060
to build an arsenal instead, weren't you?

81
04:33.060 --> 04:34.590
Listen to me now. Listen to me.

82
04:34.590 --> 04:35.890
I just don't understand.

83
04:35.890 --> 04:36.990
Don't I deserve

84
04:37.060 --> 04:38.400
even a little bit of trust?

85
04:38.400 --> 04:40.909
For the Officers' Club reception next month,

86
04:40.909 --> 04:41.850
did I give you

87
04:41.880 --> 04:42.820
full authority to handle it or not?

88
04:42.820 --> 04:44.580
The reception won't be a problem, of course.

89
04:44.580 --> 04:45.080
But...

90
04:45.820 --> 04:46.860
But I want to help you

91
04:46.860 --> 04:48.380
with military affairs,

92
04:48.380 --> 04:50.510
not just social events.

93
04:50.659 --> 04:52.140
I asked you to get in touch with bankers

94
04:52.140 --> 04:53.159
and arms dealers.

95
04:53.480 --> 04:54.159
Have you done it?

96
04:54.159 --> 04:55.120
Of course I have.

97
04:59.180 --> 04:59.840
You mean...

98
05:00.600 --> 05:01.760
From now on, besides beer and skittles,

99
05:01.120 --> 05:09.910
[Dispatch Room]

100
05:01.800 --> 05:02.600
you can count on me

101
05:02.600 --> 05:03.860
as your right-hand man.

102
05:03.860 --> 05:04.290
Seriously.

103
05:04.290 --> 05:05.820
Let me break it down for you.

104
05:06.240 --> 05:06.890
Those banks

105
05:06.890 --> 05:07.940
might not have the financial clout,

106
05:07.940 --> 05:08.540
so they might not be able to

107
05:08.540 --> 05:09.640
cover these costs.

108
05:20.600 --> 05:22.880
You seem a bit distracted.

109
05:25.960 --> 05:26.720
Dad.

110
05:27.780 --> 05:29.640
Changxuan called a meeting today

111
05:29.940 --> 05:31.980
to propose building an arsenal.

112
05:32.620 --> 05:33.750
Most of the veterans

113
05:34.040 --> 05:34.920
opposed it.

114
05:38.140 --> 05:39.340
What's your opinion?

115
05:41.580 --> 05:42.880
Changxuan has innovative ideas

116
05:42.880 --> 05:44.020
and is keeping up with the times.

117
05:44.020 --> 05:45.550
That's worth encouraging.

118
05:46.159 --> 05:47.020
Maybe you could

119
05:47.720 --> 05:48.580
give him a hand?

120
05:50.940 --> 05:52.780
Didn't he confidently promise

121
05:53.240 --> 05:55.400
to show me a new side of himself?

122
05:56.659 --> 05:57.860
I'm staying out of it.

123
05:58.280 --> 05:59.040
Let him figure out how to overcome

124
05:59.040 --> 06:00.580
the obstacles himself.

125
06:04.520 --> 06:05.380
It's your turn.

126
06:10.220 --> 06:11.370
[Nishang Garments]

127
06:12.540 --> 06:13.940
I'm sorry, Changxuan.

128
06:14.080 --> 06:19.190
[Nishang Garments]

129
06:14.610 --> 06:16.210
Regarding the arsenal,

130
06:16.440 --> 06:18.570
my father can't invest directly in it.

131
06:20.320 --> 06:21.760
It's okay. I understand.

132
06:23.120 --> 06:24.400
But I've already contacted

133
06:24.400 --> 06:26.020
a few senior bankers

134
06:26.220 --> 06:27.870
who've known me since I was a child.

135
06:27.870 --> 06:29.670
They're very close to my father.

136
06:29.860 --> 06:32.340
I'll introduce you at the reception.

137
06:32.380 --> 06:32.870
Ziyi.

138
06:33.520 --> 06:34.680
Thank you for everything you've done for me.

139
06:34.680 --> 06:35.740
Candied hawthorn!

140
06:36.159 --> 06:37.540
Candied hawthorn for sale!

141
06:37.540 --> 06:39.230
An arsenal is a major undertaking.

142
06:39.230 --> 06:41.220
Of course I'll do everything I can to help.

143
06:41.220 --> 06:42.220
Besides,

144
06:42.250 --> 06:43.850
if I don't help you, who will?

145
06:52.320 --> 06:54.250
[Nishang Garments]

146
07:12.030 --> 07:14.380
[Lounge]

147
07:21.400 --> 07:22.860
Does this piece look good?

148
07:24.180 --> 07:24.960
Not bad.

149
07:25.940 --> 07:27.050
But I think

150
07:27.160 --> 07:28.890
the next one might look better.

151
07:30.550 --> 07:31.420
Can't you just tell me

152
07:31.420 --> 07:32.600
I look good?

153
07:34.180 --> 07:35.240
Go change already.

154
07:37.860 --> 07:42.950
[Nishang Garments]

155
08:16.940 --> 08:19.830
[Children's World]

156
08:19.970 --> 08:23.760
[Children's Educational Textbooks]

157
08:23.410 --> 08:24.000
Xueting.

158
08:24.640 --> 08:26.020
I want to order some books

159
08:26.020 --> 08:27.950
for the children at the orphanage.

160
08:27.980 --> 08:28.480
Sure.

161
08:28.920 --> 08:30.050
Let's get a variety.

162
08:31.840 --> 08:33.539
Osmanthus cakes for sale!

163
08:34.960 --> 08:35.760
Pingjun.

164
08:36.260 --> 08:37.860
I'll go buy some osmanthus cakes.

165
08:37.860 --> 08:39.190
We can share them later.

166
08:46.330 --> 08:54.880
[Children's Educational Textbooks]

167
09:05.360 --> 09:06.400
Is it stuck?

168
09:19.600 --> 09:20.700
Why are you here?

169
09:21.540 --> 09:23.600
To soak up some literary atmosphere.

170
09:23.990 --> 09:24.920
Give me the book.

171
09:25.150 --> 09:26.860
I got it first.

172
09:28.460 --> 09:29.920
Why should I give it to you?

173
09:32.260 --> 09:33.060
Mr. Yu.

174
09:33.800 --> 09:36.260
Couldn't you try being reasonable for once?

175
09:38.300 --> 09:39.160
Be reasonable?

176
09:40.880 --> 09:41.940
What's in it for me?

177
09:43.760 --> 09:44.800
Give me the book.

178
09:53.060 --> 09:54.260
You want it that much?

179
10:18.160 --> 10:19.080
Let go...

180
10:27.040 --> 10:29.160
I think these all look lovely.

181
10:31.560 --> 10:32.220
Changxuan.

182
10:32.960 --> 10:34.750
[Nishang Garments]

183
10:37.620 --> 10:38.400
Changxuan?

184
10:40.790 --> 10:41.850
Please come again.

185
10:43.550 --> 10:44.410
Jiang Xueting?

186
10:47.390 --> 10:48.090
Miss Tao.

187
10:49.250 --> 10:50.370
Why are you here?

188
10:51.560 --> 10:52.890
Are you with Ye Pingjun?

189
10:53.220 --> 10:53.740
Yes.

190
10:54.140 --> 10:54.950
Pingjun and I

191
10:55.060 --> 10:57.390
are ordering some books in the bookstore.

192
11:02.880 --> 11:03.660
Perfect.

193
11:04.120 --> 11:05.980
I want to check out some books too.

194
11:06.660 --> 11:07.860
Yu Changxuan, let go.

195
11:21.400 --> 11:22.580
You bite me once,

196
11:24.380 --> 11:26.140
I'll bite you back 10 times.

197
11:28.220 --> 11:29.060
Do you really think

198
11:29.060 --> 11:30.660
you can do whatever you want?

199
11:33.100 --> 11:34.160
As long as I want to.

200
11:35.450 --> 11:44.060
[Reading Area]

201
12:10.540 --> 12:11.460
You two...

202
12:11.990 --> 12:13.920
How come you two arrived together?

203
12:16.260 --> 12:17.600
I happened to run into Miss Tao

204
12:17.600 --> 12:19.380
on the street just now.

205
12:29.880 --> 12:30.480
Ziyi.

206
12:32.240 --> 12:35.670
[Nishang Garments]

207
12:36.380 --> 12:37.620
Where did you go?

208
12:37.620 --> 12:38.860
You didn't even tell me.

209
12:38.860 --> 12:40.460
I had to look all over for you.

210
12:40.540 --> 12:41.400
I didn't go far.

211
12:41.720 --> 12:43.780
Just took a stroll around the market.

212
12:47.680 --> 12:48.680
Secretary Jiang.

213
12:49.040 --> 12:49.800
Miss Ye.

214
12:51.460 --> 12:52.590
What a coincidence.

215
12:53.020 --> 12:53.680
Commander.

216
12:54.220 --> 12:55.600
What are you two doing here?

217
12:55.600 --> 12:57.600
Pingjun and I came to this bookstore

218
12:57.880 --> 12:58.940
to order some books

219
12:59.100 --> 13:01.030
for the children at the orphanage.

220
13:01.800 --> 13:03.220
How's the translation work going?

221
13:03.220 --> 13:05.020
I've finished it ahead of schedule.

222
13:05.020 --> 13:07.350
Secretary Jiang, you're very efficient.

223
13:08.140 --> 13:09.460
I admire your ability

224
13:09.960 --> 13:10.920
and dedication.

225
13:13.000 --> 13:16.260
I owe that to you for giving me the opportunity, Commander.

226
13:17.460 --> 13:18.320
This Saturday,

227
13:18.600 --> 13:20.130
at the Officers' Club ball,

228
13:20.600 --> 13:22.520
there'll be German experts

229
13:22.520 --> 13:24.140
specializing in military technology.

230
13:24.140 --> 13:25.240
You'll need to accompany them

231
13:25.240 --> 13:27.300
and interpret throughout the event.

232
13:27.720 --> 13:29.000
Make sure you're prepared.

233
13:29.000 --> 13:29.660
No problem.

234
13:30.140 --> 13:32.540
I'll make all the necessary preparations.

235
13:32.880 --> 13:34.280
Remember to bring a date.

236
13:36.180 --> 13:37.240
We'll be off, then.

237
13:46.180 --> 13:46.740
Pingjun.

238
13:48.000 --> 13:48.800
What's wrong?

239
13:51.260 --> 13:52.080
Nothing.

240
13:53.400 --> 13:53.930
Let's go.

241
14:09.020 --> 14:10.620
Why do you keep looking at me?

242
14:12.760 --> 14:13.340
Nothing.

243
14:15.140 --> 14:16.880
You're just like when you were little,

244
14:16.880 --> 14:18.420
loving osmanthus cake so much.

245
14:18.420 --> 14:19.950
You haven't changed at all.

246
14:20.080 --> 14:21.720
Neither have you, right?

247
14:25.740 --> 14:26.280
Pingjun.

248
14:27.640 --> 14:29.440
Actually, when I was in Japan...

249
14:31.360 --> 14:32.740
What happened in Japan?

250
14:35.890 --> 14:36.890
Nothing.

251
14:37.220 --> 14:38.420
You've got some here.

252
14:43.640 --> 14:44.200
How is it?

253
14:44.580 --> 14:45.440
Did I get it off?

254
15:36.500 --> 15:37.300
Mrs. Zhao.

255
15:40.800 --> 15:41.460
Xueting...

256
15:41.500 --> 15:43.010
I was just looking at this basin of water,

257
15:43.010 --> 15:44.090
and accidentally

258
15:44.340 --> 15:45.540
splashed it on you.

259
15:45.540 --> 15:46.640
This... This is just...

260
15:46.640 --> 15:47.760
I'm so sorry about that.

261
15:47.760 --> 15:48.780
My god.

262
15:50.600 --> 15:51.240
Xueting.

263
15:53.080 --> 15:53.760
It's okay.

264
15:54.640 --> 15:55.850
I've had enough water

265
15:55.870 --> 15:56.960
and enough cake.

266
15:57.360 --> 15:57.700
Here.

267
16:08.520 --> 16:10.020
Hurry back and get changed,

268
16:10.020 --> 16:11.280
or you'll catch a cold.

269
16:40.080 --> 16:43.120
[Xiangxi Hotel]

270
16:56.000 --> 16:57.380
Thank you for your concern, Mr. Zhang.

271
16:57.380 --> 16:57.880
My dad

272
16:57.880 --> 16:59.170
has always been in good health.

273
16:59.170 --> 17:00.020
He often

274
17:00.040 --> 17:01.280
speaks of you at home.

275
17:01.880 --> 17:03.180
I'm flattered.

276
17:03.300 --> 17:04.160
We'll still need

277
17:04.160 --> 17:05.599
plenty of guidance from President Tao

278
17:05.599 --> 17:06.760
with our newly established commercial bank

279
17:06.760 --> 17:07.880
in Jiangzhou.

280
17:09.700 --> 17:11.560
Mr. Zhang, your bank's thriving.

281
17:11.599 --> 17:12.510
Our Yu family

282
17:12.640 --> 17:14.200
has long looked forward to collaborating with you.

283
17:14.200 --> 17:15.280
Mr. Yu, under your leadership,

284
17:15.280 --> 17:17.260
Nanhuai is bound to prosper in trade and commerce.

285
17:17.260 --> 17:17.720
Absolutely.

286
17:17.720 --> 17:18.859
Ziyi also mentioned

287
17:18.859 --> 17:20.599
the matter of investing in the arsenal to me.

288
17:20.599 --> 17:22.599
Our bank takes this very seriously.

289
17:23.359 --> 17:24.079
It's just that

290
17:24.079 --> 17:26.040
the amount of capital required is substantial,

291
17:26.040 --> 17:27.960
so we're still assessing the risks.

292
17:27.960 --> 17:29.220
Please rest assured, Mr. Yu.

293
17:29.220 --> 17:30.220
As soon as we have any news,

294
17:30.220 --> 17:31.340
we'll discuss the details with you

295
17:31.340 --> 17:33.500
and finalize an investment plan.

296
17:33.500 --> 17:34.520
Mr. Zhang,

297
17:34.600 --> 17:35.940
you mustn't hesitate.

298
17:36.380 --> 17:38.600
Changxuan is now in command of the Ninth Army.

299
17:38.600 --> 17:39.520
The future of the arsenal

300
17:39.520 --> 17:40.920
is bound to be promising.

301
17:40.960 --> 17:41.960
I won't hesitate.

302
17:41.960 --> 17:42.680
When it comes to funding,

303
17:42.680 --> 17:44.980
our bank will certainly prioritize the Yu family.

304
17:44.980 --> 17:46.320
After all, we'll need your support

305
17:46.320 --> 17:48.650
to expand our railway and port operations

306
17:48.780 --> 17:50.940
in Nanhuai, Mr. Yu.

307
17:51.030 --> 17:52.280
Thank you for your consideration, Mr. Zhang.

308
17:52.280 --> 17:53.280
Don't mention it.

309
17:54.340 --> 17:55.040
Mr. Yu.

310
17:55.040 --> 17:56.780
-Nice to meet you. -Hello, Uncle.

311
17:56.780 --> 17:57.710
Nice to meet you.

312
18:05.220 --> 18:05.930
Here.

313
18:06.000 --> 18:07.520
Long time no see, Uncle.

314
18:07.560 --> 18:08.760
Yes, long time no see.

315
18:16.960 --> 18:17.520
Pingjun.

316
18:18.280 --> 18:19.610
Let's go sit over there.

317
18:20.240 --> 18:20.760
Okay.

318
18:25.140 --> 18:26.500
Gentlemen, cheers.

319
18:27.230 --> 18:28.290
-Cheers. -Cheers.

320
18:31.220 --> 18:31.820
Xueting.

321
18:32.900 --> 18:33.900
Secretary Jiang.

322
18:33.920 --> 18:35.320
Having a lovely lady by your side today

323
18:35.320 --> 18:36.900
seems to have put you in quite high spirits.

324
18:36.900 --> 18:37.640
Team Leader Bao.

325
18:37.640 --> 18:38.640
Let me introduce.

326
18:38.800 --> 18:40.730
This is my girlfriend, Ye Pingjun.

327
18:40.920 --> 18:42.020
This is the leader of our translation team,

328
18:42.020 --> 18:42.680
Bao Shijie.

329
18:42.700 --> 18:44.400
This is my colleague, Zhang Yingmei.

330
18:44.400 --> 18:44.800
Hello.

331
18:45.100 --> 18:45.660
Hello.

332
18:46.180 --> 18:47.440
Thank you for always

333
18:47.440 --> 18:48.770
taking care of Xueting.

334
18:48.920 --> 18:49.560
Miss Ye,

335
18:49.600 --> 18:50.540
nice to meet you.

336
18:50.720 --> 18:52.500
It's just that we have official business to attend to,

337
18:52.500 --> 18:53.560
so I'm afraid Xueting can't give you

338
18:53.560 --> 18:55.020
his full attention today.

339
18:55.180 --> 18:56.460
It's okay, you guys go ahead.

340
18:56.460 --> 18:57.660
We can catch up later.

341
18:57.660 --> 18:58.860
See you around, then.

342
18:59.000 --> 18:59.760
We're off.

343
19:02.020 --> 19:02.700
Pingjun.

344
19:03.200 --> 19:03.800
Sorry

345
19:04.900 --> 19:05.800
to drag you along

346
19:05.800 --> 19:07.400
to this kind of social event.

347
19:07.420 --> 19:08.160
It's fine.

348
19:08.220 --> 19:09.420
Don't worry about me.

349
19:09.660 --> 19:10.800
I'll get you something to eat.

350
19:10.800 --> 19:11.400
No need.

351
19:11.720 --> 19:12.780
I can get it myself.

352
19:13.120 --> 19:13.960
They're waiting for you.

353
19:13.960 --> 19:15.220
Go ahead and join them.

354
19:16.020 --> 19:16.500
Go on.

355
19:25.460 --> 19:26.460
Gentlemen.

356
19:26.720 --> 19:27.300
I have

357
19:27.340 --> 19:28.040
prepared some

358
19:28.040 --> 19:29.360
Riesling white wine

359
19:29.420 --> 19:31.290
to liven up tonight's tasting.

360
19:31.400 --> 19:32.950
Why don't we enjoy a few glasses

361
19:32.950 --> 19:34.210
to get things started?

362
19:34.300 --> 19:34.950
Sounds great.

363
19:34.950 --> 19:35.810
Changxuan,

364
19:35.900 --> 19:37.120
what do you think?

365
19:37.280 --> 19:38.660
At a banquet like this, following Ziyi's lead

366
19:38.660 --> 19:40.120
is always the best choice.

367
19:41.350 --> 19:42.350
This way, please.

368
19:42.700 --> 19:43.160
Please.

369
19:43.400 --> 19:45.750
Building an arsenal

370
19:45.900 --> 19:47.340
means establishing

371
19:47.980 --> 19:51.160
a complete military-industrial complex.

372
19:51.360 --> 19:53.370
I wonder how determined Mr. Yu is

373
19:53.560 --> 19:55.900
to see this through?

374
19:58.260 --> 20:00.120
Mr. Yu places great importance on

375
20:00.260 --> 20:01.800
the development of military technology

376
20:01.800 --> 20:02.740
and has put

377
20:02.940 --> 20:06.140
a tremendous amount of effort into the defense industry.

378
20:06.600 --> 20:07.780
He's not just looking

379
20:07.780 --> 20:09.440
to build some ordinary arsenal—

380
20:09.440 --> 20:11.340
rather, he intends to build

381
20:12.000 --> 20:14.960
a first-class arsenal in Nanhuai

382
20:15.500 --> 20:16.560
to provide ample weapons, ammunition,

383
20:16.560 --> 20:18.960
and heavy equipment.

384
20:20.800 --> 20:21.660
Hello, expert.

385
20:21.680 --> 20:24.460
That batch of goods has arrived at Pingjiang Port.

386
20:24.460 --> 20:25.840
As you know, military vehicles

387
20:25.840 --> 20:28.570
would be the most convenient way to transport it.

388
20:29.220 --> 20:30.850
If you can help us out,

389
20:31.140 --> 20:33.280
you'll be handsomely rewarded.

390
20:33.400 --> 20:35.200
Military vehicles are in high demand

391
20:35.200 --> 20:37.200
and there aren't many to begin with.

392
20:37.560 --> 20:38.720
They can't just be borrowed

393
20:38.720 --> 20:39.780
at anyone's request.

394
20:39.780 --> 20:42.120
The number of vehicles and the time they're used

395
20:42.120 --> 20:43.520
are strictly regulated.

396
20:43.520 --> 20:45.660
Besides, the personnel who maintain the vehicle logs

397
20:45.660 --> 20:46.940
operate independently

398
20:46.940 --> 20:48.780
and don't report to the Quartermaster's Office.

399
20:48.780 --> 20:49.960
I'm afraid there's nothing I can do.

400
20:49.960 --> 20:50.890
I'm truly sorry.

401
20:52.100 --> 20:53.080
It's alright, it's alright.

402
20:53.080 --> 20:54.880
I'll figure something else out.

403
20:58.680 --> 20:59.270
Look.

404
20:59.890 --> 21:01.090
What's he doing here?

405
21:02.040 --> 21:03.240
Isn't that Yang Shiying—

406
21:03.240 --> 21:04.580
a trusted aide to Marshal Xu of the Cheng Army,

407
21:04.580 --> 21:05.840
also known as Staff Officer Yang?

408
21:05.840 --> 21:07.780
He's a man with connections everywhere.

409
21:07.780 --> 21:09.080
Not only is he

410
21:09.080 --> 21:10.340
the brains behind the marshal,

411
21:10.340 --> 21:11.120
but he also

412
21:11.150 --> 21:13.420
has direct ties to the top brass in the central government.

413
21:13.420 --> 21:15.720
Staff Officer Yang isn't someone you can easily get to show up.

414
21:15.720 --> 21:18.120
It seems he's on very good terms with Mr. Yu.

415
21:32.460 --> 21:33.300
It's you.

416
21:36.380 --> 21:37.240
Mr. Yu.

417
21:37.720 --> 21:39.690
Pardon me for not seeing you out.

418
21:39.800 --> 21:40.440
Goodbye.

419
21:47.520 --> 21:48.300
I'm sorry,

420
21:48.580 --> 21:50.580
but I think you must've mistaken me for someone else.

421
21:50.580 --> 21:51.660
Have you forgotten?

422
21:51.660 --> 21:53.200
We met that day on Changping Mountain,

423
21:53.200 --> 21:55.170
when you and Mr. Yu

424
21:55.300 --> 21:56.630
went boating together.

425
21:56.900 --> 21:57.800
I'm sorry,

426
21:57.800 --> 21:59.040
but I really can't remember

427
21:59.040 --> 22:00.000
where we've met.

428
22:00.130 --> 22:01.260
Staff Officer Yang.

429
22:02.140 --> 22:02.720
Mr. Yu.

430
22:02.820 --> 22:04.290
I've been waiting for you.

431
22:04.520 --> 22:06.580
Sorry for not welcoming you earlier.

432
22:06.680 --> 22:07.220
Pingjun.

433
22:10.480 --> 22:11.340
What happened?

434
22:13.920 --> 22:16.650
This gentleman just mistook me for someone else.

435
22:17.920 --> 22:18.920
Let me introduce.

436
22:19.100 --> 22:20.360
This is my girlfriend,

437
22:20.840 --> 22:21.600
Tao Ziyi.

438
22:22.060 --> 22:23.000
Staff Officer Yang.

439
22:23.000 --> 22:23.760
I've heard so much about you.

440
22:23.760 --> 22:24.690
Nice to meet you.

441
22:24.700 --> 22:26.160
Nice to meet you, Miss Tao.

442
22:28.020 --> 22:29.340
And who's this lady?

443
22:32.520 --> 22:34.000
Let me introduce them as well.

444
22:34.000 --> 22:35.160
This is our staff department's

445
22:35.160 --> 22:36.120
translation secretary,

446
22:36.120 --> 22:36.980
Jiang Xueting.

447
22:37.990 --> 22:38.840
And this

448
22:39.600 --> 22:40.790
is his girlfriend,

449
22:41.260 --> 22:42.400
Miss Ye Pingjun.

450
22:45.340 --> 22:47.000
She's also Ziyi's classmate.

451
22:50.080 --> 22:51.210
Staff Officer Yang.

452
22:51.400 --> 22:51.920
Nice to meet you.

453
22:51.920 --> 22:52.600
Nice to meet you.

454
22:52.600 --> 22:53.530
Nice to meet you.

455
22:54.000 --> 22:55.600
I'm really sorry.

456
22:56.160 --> 22:58.360
I mistook her for someone else just now.

457
22:58.820 --> 23:00.380
She looks so much like

458
23:00.380 --> 23:01.510
someone I once knew.

459
23:05.650 --> 23:06.490
It's alright.

460
23:06.900 --> 23:08.160
There're plenty of people in this world

461
23:08.160 --> 23:09.170
who look alike.

462
23:09.350 --> 23:10.480
Staff Officer Yang.

463
23:10.920 --> 23:12.720
You don't have to worry about it.

464
23:21.150 --> 23:22.410
Ladies and gentlemen,

465
23:22.640 --> 23:24.520
and friends from the banking sector,

466
23:24.520 --> 23:25.860
please allow me to introduce

467
23:25.860 --> 23:27.560
Chief of Staff to Marshal Xu

468
23:27.560 --> 23:28.660
of the Cheng Army,

469
23:29.100 --> 23:30.260
Mr. Yang Shiying.

470
23:31.510 --> 23:32.720
Staff Officer Yang is here too?

471
23:32.720 --> 23:33.710
It really is him.

472
23:33.760 --> 23:35.820
Mr. Yu must have quite the influence.

473
23:37.800 --> 23:38.680
Everyone.

474
23:39.900 --> 23:41.960
Mr. Yu is my sworn brother.

475
23:42.580 --> 23:44.580
We're as close as brothers by blood.

476
23:45.080 --> 23:47.600
Today, I'm not just here to catch up,

477
23:48.220 --> 23:50.100
but also to talk business.

478
23:50.900 --> 23:51.820
Our Cheng Army

479
23:52.700 --> 23:55.220
has officially placed an order

480
23:55.500 --> 23:56.260
with the Nanhuai Arsenal

481
23:56.260 --> 23:58.610
for 200,000 rifles.

482
23:59.520 --> 24:00.380
Moreover,

483
24:01.020 --> 24:03.220
we'll be working together long-term.

484
24:07.920 --> 24:08.900
Yang Shiying.

485
24:09.020 --> 24:10.900
He's a man of great standing in both the Cheng Army

486
24:10.900 --> 24:12.620
and the central government.

487
24:12.720 --> 24:14.080
For Mr. Yu, a junior,

488
24:14.150 --> 24:16.000
to have such close ties with him

489
24:16.040 --> 24:17.540
is a promising sign.

490
24:17.580 --> 24:19.320
It seems that in preparing the arsenal,

491
24:19.320 --> 24:21.420
even if the old guard within the Yu Army doesn't support it,

492
24:21.420 --> 24:22.300
he has the Cheng Army

493
24:22.300 --> 24:23.500
and Yang Shiying backing him up.

494
24:23.500 --> 24:25.140
The potential returns are immeasurable.

495
24:25.140 --> 24:25.870
Absolutely.

496
24:32.520 --> 24:33.860
Thank you, Staff Officer Yang,

497
24:33.860 --> 24:36.260
for coming here today to show your support.

498
24:37.680 --> 24:40.010
Mr. Yu, I truly admire your determination

499
24:40.010 --> 24:41.270
to reform the military

500
24:41.440 --> 24:43.160
and establish an arsenal.

501
24:44.920 --> 24:46.460
It's my honor

502
24:46.940 --> 24:48.220
to lend you a hand.

503
24:50.100 --> 24:51.720
What I'd really like is for us to support each other

504
24:51.720 --> 24:53.480
in the years to come, Staff Officer Yang,

505
24:53.480 --> 24:54.540
and stand together

506
24:55.300 --> 24:56.760
in these turbulent times.

507
25:01.020 --> 25:02.720
Who knows

508
25:03.140 --> 25:04.420
what the future holds?

509
25:06.460 --> 25:08.320
Take you and Miss Ye, for example.

510
25:09.080 --> 25:12.660
Last time I saw you together, you seemed like a match made in heaven.

511
25:12.660 --> 25:15.260
Yet today, you've both found other companions

512
25:16.080 --> 25:17.600
and act like strangers.

513
25:20.300 --> 25:21.230
Regarding this,

514
25:21.620 --> 25:23.480
you've misunderstood, Mr. Yang.

515
25:23.520 --> 25:25.160
Miss Ye and I have always been

516
25:26.600 --> 25:27.930
just ordinary friends.

517
25:30.710 --> 25:32.440
When we met last time,

518
25:33.460 --> 25:34.780
I was very impressed

519
25:34.780 --> 25:36.450
by Miss Ye.

520
25:38.860 --> 25:41.020
Since you two are just ordinary friends,

521
25:41.020 --> 25:42.360
Mr. Yu, would you mind

522
25:42.360 --> 25:44.010
if I took this opportunity

523
25:44.220 --> 25:46.300
to get to know Miss Ye better?

524
25:48.440 --> 25:49.360
Of course not.

525
25:53.520 --> 25:53.900
Here.

526
25:58.110 --> 25:59.280
You're good.

527
26:02.660 --> 26:03.210
Please, sit.

528
26:03.210 --> 26:03.940
Come on, sit.

529
26:05.700 --> 26:06.700
How can you play mahjong

530
26:06.700 --> 26:08.300
without me?

531
26:08.600 --> 26:09.200
Everyone,

532
26:09.920 --> 26:11.080
how's the game going?

533
26:11.080 --> 26:12.210
Staff Officer Yang.

534
26:12.220 --> 26:14.200
Secretary Jiang's been incredibly lucky today.

535
26:14.200 --> 26:15.020
He's the only one who's won a hand.

536
26:15.020 --> 26:15.780
The rest of us haven't won a single one,

537
26:15.780 --> 26:16.180
right?

538
26:16.500 --> 26:17.140
Is that so?

539
26:17.520 --> 26:18.520
Secretary Jiang.

540
26:18.900 --> 26:21.020
I never admit defeat in 2 places.

541
26:22.020 --> 26:23.110
One is the battlefield,

542
26:23.110 --> 26:24.840
and the other is the card table.

543
26:25.160 --> 26:26.050
So today,

544
26:26.300 --> 26:28.230
I need to have a good match with him.

545
26:29.960 --> 26:30.890
It was mere luck.

546
26:31.500 --> 26:32.780
Are you looking down on me

547
26:32.780 --> 26:33.920
by saying that?

548
26:34.660 --> 26:35.520
I wouldn't dare.

549
26:35.520 --> 26:36.520
Secretary Jiang,

550
26:37.220 --> 26:39.620
we should show our hospitality as the host.

551
26:54.020 --> 26:56.160
In my book,

552
26:56.280 --> 26:58.480
it's no fun without something at stake.

553
26:59.280 --> 27:00.610
What do you have in mind?

554
27:01.100 --> 27:02.600
Whoever wins a hand

555
27:02.630 --> 27:04.070
gets to make a wish,

556
27:04.860 --> 27:06.790
and the other people can't refuse.

557
27:08.050 --> 27:10.110
Since you've brought it up, Mr. Yang,

558
27:10.400 --> 27:11.370
I assume

559
27:11.700 --> 27:13.700
you already have something in mind.

560
27:14.150 --> 27:15.830
I'm quite taken with

561
27:16.480 --> 27:17.520
Miss Ye,

562
27:18.070 --> 27:19.840
and I feel we have a certain connection.

563
27:19.840 --> 27:21.080
If I win a hand,

564
27:21.340 --> 27:22.660
would you do me the honor

565
27:22.660 --> 27:23.720
of a dance, Miss Ye?

566
27:31.680 --> 27:32.400
You two

567
27:32.780 --> 27:33.840
don't mind, do you?

568
27:36.980 --> 27:37.510
Alright.

569
27:38.020 --> 27:38.950
It's a deal then.

570
27:39.640 --> 27:40.770
Staff Officer Yang.

571
27:41.110 --> 27:42.080
Aren't you being a bit

572
27:42.080 --> 27:43.140
too much of a bully?

573
27:44.840 --> 27:46.940
After all, Secretary Jiang is still here.

574
27:46.940 --> 27:48.900
How could he bear to let his girlfriend

575
27:48.900 --> 27:49.980
dance with you?

576
27:52.160 --> 27:53.420
Miss Tao, you're here.

577
27:53.420 --> 27:54.620
This game

578
27:54.640 --> 27:56.770
is getting more and more interesting.

579
27:57.660 --> 27:58.440
Pingjun.

580
27:59.080 --> 27:59.960
Don't worry.

581
28:00.100 --> 28:01.500
I'll definitely help you

582
28:01.700 --> 28:04.900
and absolutely won't let Staff Officer Yang have his way.

583
28:05.330 --> 28:06.010
Alright.

584
28:13.010 --> 28:14.000
Come on, Second Young Lady Tao.

585
28:14.000 --> 28:14.940
Sit here and play.

586
28:14.940 --> 28:15.400
Here.

587
28:23.340 --> 28:24.400
Who's going first?

588
28:28.580 --> 28:29.520
It's no big deal.

589
28:30.400 --> 28:32.560
It's just a game of mahjong.

590
28:33.230 --> 28:34.380
Besides,

591
28:34.450 --> 28:36.680
it's anyone's game, right?

592
28:38.300 --> 28:39.380
Miss Ye.

593
28:41.120 --> 28:41.920
How gracious.

594
28:48.340 --> 28:49.470
Five of Characters.

595
28:54.840 --> 28:55.960
Staff Officer Yang, since you admire

596
28:55.960 --> 28:58.200
that someone from the past so much,

597
28:58.460 --> 29:00.730
you should've pursued her relentlessly, right?

598
29:00.730 --> 29:01.770
True.

599
29:02.960 --> 29:03.580
But she

600
29:03.580 --> 29:05.440
already had someone in her heart.

601
29:10.500 --> 29:11.160
Two of Dots.

602
29:14.440 --> 29:15.500
Six of Characters.

603
29:22.200 --> 29:22.960
Five of Dots.

604
29:23.520 --> 29:24.300
Pong!

605
29:26.330 --> 29:27.460
Staff Officer Yang,

606
29:27.580 --> 29:28.730
you're about to complete

607
29:28.730 --> 29:29.860
your all-pong hand.

608
29:30.500 --> 29:31.300
White Dragon.

609
29:31.840 --> 29:32.660
Miss Ye.

610
29:33.120 --> 29:34.740
I'm already looking forward

611
29:34.880 --> 29:36.280
to the next dance.

612
29:48.560 --> 29:49.560
Eight of Bamboos.

613
29:49.700 --> 29:50.250
Chow.

614
29:50.430 --> 29:51.080
Hold on.

615
29:55.290 --> 29:55.750
Kong.

616
29:57.580 --> 29:58.620
I'm lucky.

617
29:59.720 --> 30:00.580
Interesting.

618
30:03.480 --> 30:04.140
One of Dots.

619
30:06.500 --> 30:07.230
Nine of Dots.

620
30:17.080 --> 30:17.940
Six of Bamboos.

621
30:20.460 --> 30:21.020
Chow.

622
30:24.640 --> 30:25.460
One of Bamboos.

623
30:25.460 --> 30:26.370
Mr. Yu,

624
30:27.060 --> 30:28.920
why aren't you drawing any tiles?

625
30:29.920 --> 30:31.250
Are you having bad luck?

626
30:31.840 --> 30:32.990
My girlfriend is here.

627
30:32.990 --> 30:34.120
Of course I'm saving

628
30:34.440 --> 30:35.770
all my good luck for her.

629
30:37.600 --> 30:39.900
No wonder I've been on

630
30:39.920 --> 30:41.520
such a winning streak today.

631
30:41.900 --> 30:42.700
White Dragon.

632
30:44.860 --> 30:45.480
West Wind.

633
30:55.500 --> 30:56.360
Nine of Bamboo.

634
30:59.500 --> 31:00.500
Secretary Jiang,

635
31:01.290 --> 31:03.220
are you waiting for a winning tile?

636
31:03.430 --> 31:04.320
Then it's hard to say

637
31:04.320 --> 31:05.600
who'll win now.

638
31:08.180 --> 31:09.180
Secretary Jiang.

639
31:10.220 --> 31:11.860
You and Miss Ye seem to

640
31:11.860 --> 31:12.670
have a very

641
31:13.520 --> 31:14.720
close relationship.

642
31:16.100 --> 31:17.380
Xueting and I

643
31:17.380 --> 31:18.400
have shared the same interests since childhood.

644
31:18.400 --> 31:20.400
We talk about everything.

645
31:20.800 --> 31:22.580
Even when he was studying abroad,

646
31:22.580 --> 31:23.780
we never stopped

647
31:23.780 --> 31:25.040
writing to each other.

648
31:27.250 --> 31:27.980
Nine of Dots.

649
31:30.570 --> 31:32.790
This kind of unbreakable bond

650
31:33.310 --> 31:34.860
is truly something to envy.

651
31:36.020 --> 31:36.950
Isn't it, Mr. Yu?

652
31:43.860 --> 31:44.740
Four of Characters.

653
31:44.740 --> 31:45.200
Pong.

654
31:48.000 --> 31:49.130
Five of Characters.

655
31:51.200 --> 31:52.000
Seven of Dots.

656
31:52.760 --> 31:53.220
Pong.

657
31:56.270 --> 31:57.000
Eight of Characters.

658
31:57.000 --> 31:57.520
Kong.

659
31:59.220 --> 32:00.220
The last Eight of Characters,

660
32:00.220 --> 32:01.360
and you drew it.

661
32:01.440 --> 32:02.600
Alright, Mr. Yu.

662
32:03.020 --> 32:04.380
Your luck is back.

663
32:10.980 --> 32:11.460
Three of Characters.

664
32:11.460 --> 32:11.980
Pong.

665
32:15.220 --> 32:16.020
Eight of Dots.

666
32:18.220 --> 32:19.160
Mr. Yang,

667
32:19.200 --> 32:21.090
you're only one tile away

668
32:21.110 --> 32:22.340
from winning.

669
32:23.520 --> 32:26.240
I've got everything ready—

670
32:26.840 --> 32:29.030
just waiting for the final piece.

671
32:36.080 --> 32:37.210
Five of Characters.

672
32:49.700 --> 32:50.600
Careful now.

673
32:51.500 --> 32:52.640
The tile in your hand

674
32:52.640 --> 32:54.240
might be exactly what I need.

675
32:55.900 --> 32:56.700
That's right.

676
32:56.960 --> 32:58.390
You'd better be careful.

677
32:58.600 --> 33:00.200
The outcome of this game

678
33:00.380 --> 33:01.910
is a matter of a man's pride.

679
33:04.060 --> 33:05.060
Secretary Jiang.

680
33:05.100 --> 33:06.280
Don't be so nervous.

681
33:07.820 --> 33:09.160
Show some guts.

682
33:20.770 --> 33:22.190
It's okay, Xueting.

683
33:22.310 --> 33:23.780
It's just a dance.

684
33:24.420 --> 33:25.950
No matter who my partner is,

685
33:26.580 --> 33:27.760
I'm yours.

686
33:36.250 --> 33:38.850
Miss Ye, you're so open and forthright.

687
33:40.520 --> 33:42.220
A true heroine, indeed.

688
33:42.460 --> 33:43.000
Good.

689
33:49.420 --> 33:50.020
East Wind.

690
33:59.220 --> 34:00.350
Staff Officer Yang.

691
34:00.650 --> 34:01.470
Aren't you...

692
34:01.960 --> 34:02.690
Going to win?

693
34:05.260 --> 34:06.280
I'm not.

694
34:06.780 --> 34:08.780
That's not the tile I'm waiting for.

695
34:18.500 --> 34:19.300
Three of Dots.

696
34:23.540 --> 34:24.199
One of Dots.

697
34:27.300 --> 34:28.500
Three of Characters.

698
34:30.780 --> 34:31.840
One of Characters.

699
34:32.940 --> 34:33.800
Four of Bamboo.

700
34:42.250 --> 34:42.989
I win.

701
34:49.159 --> 34:50.159
There's nothing I can do.

702
34:50.159 --> 34:50.920
They really are

703
34:50.920 --> 34:53.210
a match made in heaven.

704
34:54.460 --> 34:56.580
Looks like I'm not lucky enough

705
34:56.580 --> 34:58.640
to have a dance with Miss Ye after all.

706
35:25.500 --> 35:26.420
Mr. Yu, they say

707
35:26.420 --> 35:28.660
you're unbeatable at the mahjong table,

708
35:28.660 --> 35:31.390
but you weren't exactly giving it your all today.

709
35:33.220 --> 35:35.420
I suppose my mahjong skills weren't up to par.

710
35:35.420 --> 35:37.190
Was it your skills,

711
35:37.500 --> 35:39.430
or were you just being a gentleman?

712
35:42.860 --> 35:44.140
What a shame.

713
35:44.920 --> 35:46.290
The man may be smitten,

714
35:46.680 --> 35:48.610
but the lady doesn't feel the same.

715
36:28.800 --> 36:29.500
I'm sorry.

716
36:29.680 --> 36:30.880
Let me wipe it for you.

717
36:31.080 --> 36:31.540
No need.

718
36:31.580 --> 36:32.620
We can clean it up ourselves.

719
36:32.620 --> 36:33.180
Wait,

720
36:33.200 --> 36:33.860
Miss,

721
36:34.780 --> 36:36.740
this dress isn't quite worthy of you.

722
36:36.740 --> 36:38.850
I'll buy you a better one.

723
36:39.580 --> 36:40.140
Pingjun.

724
36:43.720 --> 36:44.640
Xueting. What's wrong?

725
36:44.640 --> 36:45.500
What happened?

726
36:46.020 --> 36:46.680
It's nothing.

727
36:46.680 --> 36:47.600
Where are you going?

728
36:47.600 --> 36:48.660
The arms dealer from Rheinmetall

729
36:48.660 --> 36:49.860
needs to leave early.

730
36:50.000 --> 36:51.040
We're seeing him off

731
36:51.040 --> 36:52.040
with Team Leader.

732
36:55.100 --> 36:55.680
It's fine.

733
36:55.680 --> 36:56.890
I can handle things here myself.

734
36:56.890 --> 36:57.790
You go ahead.

735
36:58.760 --> 36:59.580
Be careful, then.

736
36:59.580 --> 37:00.320
Go on.

737
37:00.980 --> 37:01.500
Let's go.

738
37:01.500 --> 37:01.740
Let's go.

739
37:01.740 --> 37:02.270
This way.

740
37:35.220 --> 37:37.010
[Dressing Room]

741
37:39.910 --> 37:41.520
[Dressing Room]

742
37:47.660 --> 37:48.460
Yu Changxuan?

743
37:49.960 --> 37:51.040
What do you want?

744
37:52.360 --> 37:53.180
You're drunk.

745
37:55.160 --> 37:56.280
Now you're scared?

746
38:01.900 --> 38:03.360
Weren't you being so sharp-tongued

747
38:03.360 --> 38:05.490
at the mahjong table just a moment ago?

748
38:06.460 --> 38:08.860
Looks like you haven't told your boyfriend

749
38:09.600 --> 38:11.000
about our relationship.

750
38:12.370 --> 38:13.990
There's nothing between us

751
38:15.020 --> 38:16.650
to speak of.

752
38:17.800 --> 38:18.920
Nothing?

753
38:22.090 --> 38:24.150
Everyone knows that you, Ye Pingjun,

754
38:25.440 --> 38:26.880
are mine.

755
38:29.000 --> 38:29.480
That was all

756
38:29.480 --> 38:31.440
an act at your birthday party.

757
38:32.240 --> 38:33.140
None of it was real,

758
38:33.140 --> 38:34.600
and you know it.

759
38:40.520 --> 38:42.050
Then what are you afraid of?

760
38:43.620 --> 38:45.220
And what are you hiding from?

761
38:48.400 --> 38:50.200
Why won't you tell Jiang Xueting

762
38:50.960 --> 38:52.360
what we are to each other?

763
38:52.360 --> 38:54.090
Because you're not important.

764
38:57.180 --> 38:58.000
Yu Changxuan.

765
38:59.260 --> 39:00.590
Did you hear me clearly?

766
39:01.640 --> 39:03.370
Because you're not important.

767
39:04.100 --> 39:05.360
You're so unimportant

768
39:05.620 --> 39:06.240
that I don't even think

769
39:06.240 --> 39:07.720
you're worth mentioning

770
39:08.300 --> 39:09.870
to Jiang Xueting.

771
39:10.100 --> 39:11.300
Because you mean absolutely nothing

772
39:11.300 --> 39:12.760
in my life.

773
39:23.070 --> 39:23.890
[Ladies' Room]

774
39:23.740 --> 39:24.380
Pingjun?

775
39:26.900 --> 39:29.320
[Ladies' Room]

776
39:27.400 --> 39:28.860
Pingjun, are you in there?

777
39:31.120 --> 39:32.980
Yu Changxuan, stop acting crazy.

778
39:34.760 --> 39:36.820
You'd better not push me to the brink.

779
39:41.860 --> 39:44.460
What does that Jiang Xueting have that I don't?

780
39:44.680 --> 39:46.290
He has no power or influence.

781
39:48.300 --> 39:49.760
What's so great about him?

782
39:49.960 --> 39:51.290
He's great in every way.

783
39:57.380 --> 39:59.640
You really think you can get away from me?

784
40:01.580 --> 40:02.740
Let me go.

785
40:06.220 --> 40:06.800
Pingjun?

786
40:08.920 --> 40:09.600
Pingjun!

787
40:24.520 --> 40:25.260
What,

788
40:27.600 --> 40:29.120
you want him

789
40:29.700 --> 40:31.230
to know about us that badly?

790
40:34.740 --> 40:35.360
Pingjun?

791
40:37.600 --> 40:38.460
Tell me,

792
40:40.680 --> 40:41.560
what would he think

793
40:41.560 --> 40:43.520
if he saw us like this,

794
40:46.220 --> 40:47.880
with our clothes in disarray?

795
40:56.760 --> 40:57.440
Pingjun?

796
40:58.220 --> 40:59.150
Are you in there?

797
41:04.300 --> 41:06.110
[Dressing Room]

798
41:11.600 --> 41:12.860
Your heart's racing.

799
41:16.040 --> 41:17.480
Are you that afraid of him finding out?
